[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745093684","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5745093684","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5745093684,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVm8sNA","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-19T20:33:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T20:33:01Z","body":"Thank you for your interest in contributing to Godot. \n\nOur security team reviewed your emails and determined that there were no security issues. In all three cases, the vulnerability requires the attacker to already have control over your filesystem and feed in specially crafted files to the Godot editor in order to make it write to an out of memory location and crash. \n\nPlease go ahead and open a regular bug reports since we do routinely fix memory safety issues as we discover them. There is no need for any special handling. \n\nPlease remember to follow the bug report template and note our rules on AI-assisted contributions https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#ai-assisted-contributions\n\nAlso, as a point of advice. If you expect an answer to your emails, it is best to hand write them so that it is clear they are coming from a person. Using an LLM to assist you is fine, but it was very clear in the emails that the reports and email were generated by an LLM. Our volunteers have to prioritize how they spend their time so it is no surprise they decided not to respond after confirming that the reports were ordinary memory safety issues and not security issues. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745093684/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5756978978","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5756978978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5756978978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVySHIg","user":{"login":"bitbutter","id":52042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter","html_url":"https://github.com/bitbutter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T07:33:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T08:27:43Z","body":"Published: https://axeghost.offprint.app/a/3mvs6zo4blo23-three-memory-safety-bugs-in-godots-untrusted-file-parsers\n2026-10-04: Edited to include live links to the PoC reproduction files for each bug in the quoted emails. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5756978978/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5841466565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5841466565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5841466565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXC20xQ","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T00:22:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T00:22:57Z","body":"Is this actually going to be fixed?\nWhether it's a security vulnerability or a memory safety issue, this problem should still be resolved.\n\nMaybe the three suggested patches that were mentioned can be put into a single pull request?\n\nSince the bugs were already publicised, I don't see a reason not to. As shown in https://github.com/Coding-Solo/godot-mcp/pull/67, merging a pull request doesn't stop you from applying for a CVE. @bitbutter","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5841466565/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5843673494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5843673494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5843673494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXE9hlg","user":{"login":"bitbutter","id":52042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter","html_url":"https://github.com/bitbutter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T05:53:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T07:22:50Z","body":"hi @Joy-less. I agree that the bugs should be fixed. I think my time is better spent finding the next ones than carrying each through the merge process. As far as I can tell, there is limited security auditing of this kind happening on Godot, and I'm currently working on further findings.\n\nMy proposed fixes were generated with LLM assistance, and Godot's contribution policy requires contributors to personally understand AI-assisted code before submitting it. I don't intend to spend my limited audit time doing that; my focus is on finding serious bugs. The security team has the information needed to take the existing fixes forward.\n\n>Whether it's a security vulnerability or a memory safety issue,\n\nThey are both; memory safety bugs that allow attacker OOB read/writes in exported games that accept certain kinds of community authored files. These are not a bugs that only manifest in the editor, as the security team claimed (this is odd because i made all this clear in my initial reports).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5843673494/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":2,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5845741086","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5845741086","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5845741086,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXG7uHg","user":{"login":"bitbutter","id":52042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter","html_url":"https://github.com/bitbutter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T11:08:37Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T11:08:37Z","body":"The document now includes redacted copies of the four emails sent to [security@godotengine.org](mailto:security@godotengine.org), so the characterization of them above can be checked against the texts.\n\nEach of the three reports includes a root-cause analysis and a suggested patch, so anyone who wants to work on fixes has a starting point.\n\nhttps://axeghost.offprint.app/a/3mvs6zo4blo23-three-memory-safety-bugs-in-godots-untrusted-file-parsers","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5845741086/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971574801","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5971574801","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5971574801,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY-8AEQ","user":{"login":"bitbutter","id":52042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter","html_url":"https://github.com/bitbutter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitbutter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T17:18:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T17:18:24Z","body":"@clayjohn should people submitting security reports to [security@godotengine.org](mailto:security@godotengine.org) assume that they get read even if months go by with no reply? it seems like wasted time for everyone if we need to open issues like this to try to find out","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971574801/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971657426","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123608#issuecomment-5971657426","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123608","id":5971657426,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY_BC0g","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-03T17:28:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T17:28:29Z","body":"> [@clayjohn](https://github.com/clayjohn) should people submitting security reports to [security@godotengine.org](mailto:security@godotengine.org) assume that they get read even if months go by with no reply? it seems like wasted time for everyone if we need to open issues like this to try to find out\n\nAs I said above, our security team reviews security reports and takes prompt action on legitimate reports. We don't feel obligated to respond to AI generated emails that are reporting ordinary memory-safety issues. \n\nTo be clear, all of this has been completely unnecessary. You are creating unnecessary work for yourself and everyone else. You should have followed the proper bug reporting process and opened bug reports. As it stands, you are just wasting my time and the time of other maintainers as you try to manufacture drama that does not exist about security vulnerabilities that do not exist.\n\nAgain, please note our AI policy https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#ai-assisted-contributions. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5971657426/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api